```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente Web
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Sim as Simulation Service
    participant SimUCI as SimUCI Engine
    participant DB as simulation-db

    Client->>Gateway: POST /simulations/icu<br/>{patient_params...}
    Gateway->>Gateway: Verificar CORS
    Gateway->>Sim: Proxy request
    Sim->>Sim: Verificar disponibilidad<br/>de SimUCI

    alt SimUCI Disponible
        Sim->>SimUCI: single_run(centroids.csv)
        SimUCI-->>Sim: Estadísticas de salida
    else SimUCI No Disponible
        Sim->>Sim: Generar seed SHA-256
        Sim->>Sim: Calcular fallback<br/>determinista
    end

    Sim->>DB: Almacenar simulación
    DB-->>Sim: ID de simulación

    Sim-->>Gateway: ICUPatientSimulation<br/>Response
    Gateway-->>Client: {simulation_results,<br/>statistics...}

    Note over Client: mean, std, CI 95%<br/>Listo para análisis clínico

    Client->>Gateway: GET /scenarios
    Gateway->>Sim: Proxy request
    Sim-->>Gateway: [{scenario_list}]
    Gateway-->>Client: Lista de escenarios<br/>disponibles
```
